<title>USA: DQE to provide services to Heinz.</title>
<headline>DQE to provide services to Heinz.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>DQE Inc said Wednesday it will provide energy services to H.J. Heinz Co's Northside Complex under a 15-year agreement.</p>
<p>DQE said it will operate and maintain the Pittsburgh Complex energy facility, including fuel procurement and the production of electricity, steam and compressed air services.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
